s($,"b9I","aOz",()=>A.aAi("As an **Intern** in Quantum Software Development at **Classiq**,under the supervision of **Dr. Gal Winer https://scholar.google.co.il/citations?user=LiMlypIAAAAJ&hl=en**. I collaborated with my team to develop and implement a **Quantum Mean Filter** for **Quantum Signal Processing**. This project utilized advanced quantum techniques such as **NEQR (Novel Enhanced Quantum Representation), ENEQR (Extended NEQR), Cyclic Shift, Quantum Full Adder, and Quantum Multiplier** to implement algorithm, processing efficiency, and filtering accuracy.",A.a(["Dr. Gal Winer https://scholar.google.co.il/citations?user=LiMlypIAAAAJ&hl=en"],t.s),u.y,"Quantum Mean Filter","Classiq"))
